│ patch_description        │ Replace the generic two-hop reward with positive pairwise congestion costs for links that │
│                          │ share a source or destination. A node has only two outgoing and two incoming links, so    │
│                          │ selecting two links that each carry substantial direct demand can concentrate load at     │
