│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ pressure_weighted_paths                                                                   │
│ patch_description        │ Replace the current uniform-mixed two-hop reward with a per-OD allocation across eligible │
│                          │ paths. Keep the positive-demand OD gate, but distribute each OD pair’s indirect reward    │
│                          │ according to path suitability: paths through lower-pressure transit nodes and using edges │
│                          │ with less direct demand receive a larger share. Normalizing the suitability weights per   │
│                          │ OD avoids rewarding every possible intermediate as if it independently carried the full   │
│                          │ traffic, while retaining broad path coverage. This directly tests the pressure-discounted │
│                          │ allocation recommendation without changing the linear terms or degree penalty.            │
