│ Field                    │ Value                                                                                     │
├──────────────────────────┼───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ two_hop_strength                                                                          │
│ patch_description        │ Reduce the two-hop reward strength from 0.56 to 0.50. The current surrogate already gives │
│                          │ strong direct-link rewards, while its two-hop terms contribute to a low                   │
│                          │ valid-before-repair rate (69% on average). A modest reduction keeps incentives for useful │
