│                          │ that aggregate indirect reward at 35% of the corresponding direct-link value. This        │
│                          │ retains the existing support- and pressure-weighted route selection while limiting how    │
│                          │ strongly indirect paths can compete with direct service, which may improve the typical    │
│                          │ sampled topology without adding quadratic terms.                                          │
