│ patch_name               │ capacity_aware_route_portfolio                                                            │
│ patch_description        │ This combines demand-based direct-link rewards with a small portfolio of capacity-aware   │
│                          │ two-hop routes. Candidate routes are ranked using estimated component-edge load and       │
│                          │ transit-node pressure, then their reward is shared across the best candidates for each OD │
│                          │ pair. It also adds sparse positive pairwise terms that discourage jointly selecting links │
│                          │ associated with two highly pressured nodes, encouraging a more balanced network. The      │
│                          │ candidate cap keeps the quadratic term count below the required limit.                    │
