│ patch_type               │ full                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ sparse_loadaware_routes                                                                   │
│ patch_description        │ The current approach spreads each OD pair’s indirect-route reward over every possible     │
│                          │ intermediate, which can make individual route terms weak. This version concentrates that  │
│                          │ reward on the three strongest candidates and discounts paths more strongly using          │
│                          │ estimated component-edge load: each edge’s direct demand plus a small endpoint-throughput │
│                          │ proxy. It retains direct-link value and a reduced traffic-profile overlap penalty, while  │
│                          │ keeping the quadratic-term count below the stated limit.                                  │
