│ patch_description        │ The current surrogate rewards direct traffic and two-hop paths, but its two-hop discount  │
│                          │ uses a relatively mild linear edge-pressure factor. This version uses a stronger,         │
│                          │ superlinear congestion discount, `(1 + edge_pressure) ** 1.5`, so paths using             │
│                          │ already-demanded edges receive less reward. It retains the concave direct-demand and      │
│                          │ path-support terms, and raises the external degree-penalty weight from 1.0 to 1.25 to     │
│                          │ encourage more valid low-energy samples before repair.                                    │
